    faq: [{ q: "Is Mr. Sammler's Planet the right Bellow to start with?", a: "It depends on what you want from Bellow. For the fullest Bellow experience, 'Herzog' (1964) is the consensus masterpiece. 'The Adventures of Augie March' (1953) is the most energetic. 'Mr. Sammler's Planet' is the most concentrated and the most politically sharp." }],
