    faq: [{ q: "What order should I read Cesare Pavese's novels in?", a: "Begin with 'The Moon and the Bonfires' as his masterpiece. Then 'The House on the Hill' (the war years) and 'The Harvesters' (his first novel). His diary 'This Business of Living' reads best after the novels." }],
